@XiongHaoTrigger Thanks for confirming that this still happens on 1.18.14. The cleanup job used reactions as one of its criteria. This PR was closed because it was over a month old and had fewer than two positive reactions. The closure was automatic, not a sign that the bug was fixed.

I have rebased the branch onto the latest dev and checked the current OpenTUI 0.4.5 teardown path. Raw mode is still disabled before native renderer cleanup, so this OpenCode-side reset is still needed. The focused renderer tests pass, along with the packages/tui typecheck, oxlint, git diff --check, and the full pre-push typecheck.

Could a maintainer reopen this PR for review? The branch is current and ready.
